1
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:03,180
[Eurylochus] What was the Sirens’ song?
[欧律罗科斯] 塞壬之歌，唱的是什么？

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:07,360
[Odysseus] All the things you’d want it to be.
[奥德修斯] 你想要它是什么，它就是什么。

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:12,680
Then all things you wish you never wished for…
然后，是你但愿从未奢望过的一切……

4
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:17,180
It was the delicious itch you go to scratch…
它是那阵撩人的痒，让你忍不住去挠……

5
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:21,900
But find it’s under the skin, and can’t be reached…
却发现它在皮肉之下，怎么也够不着……

6
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:26,490
So the delicious itch becomes unbearable…
于是，那撩人的痒，变得难以忍受……

7
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:33,620
It told you what you most want is what you most can’t have,
它告诉你：你最想要的，就是你最得不到的；

8
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:41,080
and what you most can’t have is what you already had and lost…
而最得不到的，是你曾经拥有、却已失去的……

9
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:47,880
It was the song of all the promises I’ve failed to keep…
它唱的，是我所有未能兑现的诺言……

10
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:53,800
[Odysseus] And it told me I don’t really want to go home.
[奥德修斯] 它还告诉我：其实，我并不想回家。
